WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.260 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 17]

01:38.980 --> 01:43.060
[Wanjuan Tower]

01:54.640 --> 01:55.210
Out of the way!

01:57.430 --> 01:58.460
Honestly,

01:58.950 --> 01:59.900
we've already

01:59.920 --> 02:01.210
crossed paths plenty of times.

02:02.000 --> 02:03.380
But this is the first time

02:03.790 --> 02:05.290
we've truly met, right?

02:06.350 --> 02:07.660
Leader of the Shadow Sect,

02:08.280 --> 02:09.500
Mr. Yi Bu.

02:10.150 --> 02:11.980
You're Blood River's Patriarch,

02:12.430 --> 02:13.850
Su Changhe?

02:14.430 --> 02:15.220
I am.

02:16.000 --> 02:17.730
I, Blood River's errand man,

02:18.190 --> 02:20.290
By order of Su Muyu, head of the Su family,

02:20.800 --> 02:21.450
I'm here

02:22.470 --> 02:23.610
to take your life.

02:24.780 --> 02:30.100
[Tianqi City]

02:44.340 --> 02:46.140
[Tianqi City]

03:03.540 --> 03:09.300
[Wushuang City]

03:09.300 --> 03:11.300
[Xueyue City]

03:11.300 --> 03:13.300
[Baili Dongjun]

03:27.120 --> 03:27.820
Even if you know

03:27.870 --> 03:29.820
everything about him, so what?

03:31.520 --> 03:32.890
He's still number one

03:34.120 --> 03:35.540
and you still can't handle him.

03:42.710 --> 03:43.660
That scroll

03:43.680 --> 03:44.690
you just set down

03:45.470 --> 03:46.690
is worth a hundred taels of gold.

03:48.840 --> 03:49.690
You're still here.

03:50.120 --> 03:51.060
Grandfather told me to stay.

03:51.430 --> 03:53.060
He said you might need my help.

03:54.120 --> 03:55.260
I don't want your help.

03:56.240 --> 03:57.340
I can help you find

03:58.470 --> 03:59.540
what you want.

04:00.020 --> 04:05.980
[Wanjuan]

04:23.190 --> 04:24.220
Baixiao Hall.

04:27.240 --> 04:28.220
Sword Heart Tomb.

04:31.620 --> 04:33.060
[Blood River]

04:33.360 --> 04:34.020
Blood River!

04:35.720 --> 04:36.170
Yes.

04:37.160 --> 04:38.580
All Blood River intel is here.

04:39.510 --> 04:40.220
I guess

04:40.800 --> 04:42.140
this is what you're after.

04:43.240 --> 04:43.940
But I'm not sure

04:43.940 --> 04:45.410
everything you want is in here.

04:46.120 --> 04:47.410
After all, the Shadow Sect can't know it all.

04:47.920 --> 04:48.980
Or "All-Knowing under Heaven"

04:49.160 --> 04:50.410
wouldn't belong to Baixiao Hall.

04:53.680 --> 04:55.490
These all require keys to open.

04:56.240 --> 04:57.050
And the keys

04:57.360 --> 04:58.460
are at my grandfather's house.

05:01.070 --> 05:01.610
I have them.

05:06.430 --> 05:08.050
Looks like you came prepared.

05:09.430 --> 05:10.460
I thought

05:11.360 --> 05:12.610
once I got the two keys,

05:12.680 --> 05:13.700
I'd have the answer.

05:14.560 --> 05:15.370
Then I realized

05:16.270 --> 05:17.140
with the Shadow Sect's stance,

05:17.870 --> 05:18.730
they'd never let us

05:18.750 --> 05:19.490
get inside.

05:20.390 --> 05:21.580
We'd only expose our aim

05:22.070 --> 05:23.340
and be held hostage to it.

05:24.750 --> 05:25.810
So Changhe and I

05:26.120 --> 05:27.900
made this plan in advance.

05:34.980 --> 05:37.100
[The Nameless of Blood River]

05:40.780 --> 05:42.180
[Su Muyu]

05:49.220 --> 05:54.260
[Su Muyu]

06:08.820 --> 06:14.060
[Su Muyu's Childhood]

06:27.620 --> 06:29.620
[Wushuang City launched an attack, Blood River sent ninety-three assassins]

06:29.620 --> 06:30.740
[Eighteen survived]

06:31.560 --> 06:32.340
Looks like you've found

06:32.390 --> 06:33.410
the answer you wanted.

06:50.630 --> 06:51.140
What?

06:55.800 --> 06:56.610
I dropped something.

06:57.360 --> 06:58.020
Wait for me here.

07:11.120 --> 07:12.660
Su Muyu is badly wounded...

07:14.040 --> 07:14.580
Zaiye,

07:15.120 --> 07:15.850
find an opening,

07:16.360 --> 07:18.610
put an arrow in Su Muyu's back

07:19.560 --> 07:20.490
and change the outcome

07:20.680 --> 07:22.100
of tonight's battle.

07:44.000 --> 07:44.370
What...

07:45.360 --> 07:46.370
what did you go looking for?

07:47.950 --> 07:49.340
That's not something I can tell you.

07:51.870 --> 07:52.980
Burn this whole building.

07:54.270 --> 07:55.050
Burn it?

07:55.720 --> 07:56.250
The entire place?

07:56.920 --> 07:57.250
Right.

08:17.800 --> 08:19.490
He deliberately showed

08:20.360 --> 08:21.290
that flaw just now.

08:32.550 --> 08:33.940
Truly worthy of the leader,

08:35.670 --> 08:36.890
you do have some skill.

08:37.840 --> 08:39.060
I almost lost to you.

08:44.720 --> 08:45.700
Everything...

08:47.200 --> 08:48.980
is finally over.

08:54.510 --> 08:55.980
My whole life,

08:56.960 --> 08:59.370
what did I live for?

09:14.600 --> 09:15.220
Get up!

09:16.000 --> 09:16.850
You coward!

09:17.360 --> 09:19.490
How will you rebuild the Shadow Sect one day?

09:39.240 --> 09:40.100
I will

09:41.200 --> 09:42.820
revive the Shadow Sect!

09:49.630 --> 09:50.420
I'm not the hope

09:50.440 --> 09:51.890
of the Shadow Sect.

09:57.910 --> 09:59.520
I'm just a kid.

10:00.270 --> 10:01.610
I want to go out and play.

10:06.340 --> 10:09.140
[Spirit Tablet of the Former Shadow Sect Leader]

10:19.670 --> 10:20.610
Young Leader,

10:21.120 --> 10:22.370
the former leader is gone.

10:23.030 --> 10:26.850
Please assume the seat of leader

10:27.480 --> 10:30.060
and revive the Shadow Sect!

10:31.840 --> 10:35.730
Please assume the seat of leader

10:36.030 --> 10:37.770
and revive the Shadow Sect!

10:58.180 --> 11:00.260
[Never Forget]

11:11.320 --> 11:12.850
From that day on,

11:13.720 --> 11:15.010
I became

11:16.000 --> 11:19.220
the youngest leader in our history.

11:27.630 --> 11:29.010
My whole life

11:30.720 --> 11:32.980
must count as a complete failure.

11:33.750 --> 11:34.530
The Shadow Sect

11:35.600 --> 11:37.010
wasn't restored...

11:38.870 --> 11:40.940
In my hands,

11:41.960 --> 11:43.850
it was erased.

11:46.550 --> 11:48.770
I also lost my disciple

11:52.670 --> 11:55.460
and my beloved daughter...

11:57.320 --> 11:58.700
I've heard that when you're dying,

11:59.550 --> 12:00.450
your memories

12:00.450 --> 12:01.470
flash in your mind,

12:01.470 --> 12:02.420
spinning like a lantern show.

12:04.150 --> 12:05.770
You've stared off for a while.

12:07.120 --> 12:08.700
Were you reliving your life?

12:12.270 --> 12:13.450
Stop it! Look at me!

12:18.840 --> 12:19.530
Come on...

12:20.440 --> 12:21.980
Kill me!

12:28.750 --> 12:29.420
Tell me,

12:29.910 --> 12:31.010
in Tianqi City,

12:31.720 --> 12:33.650
who knows about the tie between Blood River

12:34.320 --> 12:34.770
and the Shadow Sect?

12:35.910 --> 12:36.530
What...

12:38.750 --> 12:43.490
you plan to kill them all?

12:43.510 --> 12:44.220
Do you?

12:44.960 --> 12:45.890
And if I do?

12:49.150 --> 12:50.420
You think I can't kill you,

12:51.240 --> 12:52.650
yet I still killed all of you.

12:55.600 --> 12:56.730
Rest easy.

12:57.150 --> 12:58.370
If people learn

12:59.480 --> 13:00.580
the notorious assassin guild

13:00.630 --> 13:02.890
in the jianghu

13:03.440 --> 13:05.250
was run by the court,

13:05.910 --> 13:07.060
it would spark panic

13:08.320 --> 13:10.940
across the land.

13:12.790 --> 13:16.130
So those who know the tie

13:17.480 --> 13:20.100
are only a handful.

13:20.720 --> 13:22.850
A handful still means some.

13:23.390 --> 13:24.650
Tell me their names,

13:25.390 --> 13:26.850
and I'll leave you a whole corpse.

13:40.240 --> 13:40.770
How's it going?

13:41.670 --> 13:42.980
Find what you wanted?

13:44.840 --> 13:45.420
Found it.

13:48.750 --> 13:50.060
How do we deal with this old man?

13:52.670 --> 13:53.220
Oh,

13:53.720 --> 13:54.820
why am I asking you?

13:55.550 --> 13:57.060
I'm the Patriarch of Blood River here.

13:58.270 --> 13:59.220
If you ask me,

13:59.790 --> 14:01.100
let's cut off his limbs.

14:01.600 --> 14:02.460
Otherwise,

14:02.510 --> 14:03.490
he won't tell us

14:03.550 --> 14:04.530
who else in Tianqi City

14:04.670 --> 14:05.700
has their eyes on Blood River.

14:06.510 --> 14:08.060
Even if you cut them off,

14:08.630 --> 14:09.730
he still won't tell you.

14:10.600 --> 14:11.730
You've killed plenty.

14:12.080 --> 14:13.100
You've seen eyes like that

14:13.390 --> 14:14.610
more than once.

14:18.120 --> 14:18.890
You know,

14:18.910 --> 14:20.010
you're really dull.

14:20.510 --> 14:20.980
I only wanted

14:21.000 --> 14:22.250
to torture him a little.

14:23.510 --> 14:24.700
Anything else you want to say?

14:25.120 --> 14:26.990
Out of the last shred of conscience,

14:27.840 --> 14:28.650
I'm willing to listen.

14:38.720 --> 14:40.940
If you're a shadow...

14:44.550 --> 14:47.580
you'll be a shadow for life.

14:53.390 --> 14:54.460
A shadow

14:55.390 --> 14:57.940
that wants to step into the sun...

15:03.080 --> 15:04.890
can only vanish.

15:05.670 --> 15:06.420
You lot...

15:09.030 --> 15:11.370
will fail in the end.

15:11.670 --> 15:13.100
What rotten luck!

15:21.420 --> 15:23.340
[Yellow Springs]

15:25.150 --> 15:25.770
Su Muyu,

15:26.240 --> 15:27.300
we can call today

15:27.320 --> 15:28.180
a sweeping victory.

15:28.270 --> 15:29.650
Let me take you to Diaolou Cottage

15:29.670 --> 15:30.490
for a drink!

15:32.670 --> 15:34.220
We didn't just burn the Shadow Sect,

15:34.670 --> 15:36.100
but also the Imperial Father-in-Law's Manor it hid behind.

15:37.120 --> 15:38.730
We need to leave Tianqi City at once.

15:39.240 --> 15:40.980
If a shadow wants to step into the sun,

15:41.240 --> 15:42.300
it can only vanish.

15:43.440 --> 15:44.980
So if the Shadow Sect stopped being itself

15:45.480 --> 15:47.100
and put on the Imperial Father-in-Law's name,

15:47.840 --> 15:49.060
is that what it means

15:49.670 --> 15:50.420
for a shadow

15:50.480 --> 15:51.490
to stand in the light?

15:54.750 --> 15:55.420
So,

15:56.320 --> 15:57.820
what Yi Bu said just now

15:58.510 --> 15:59.730
wasn't only a curse on us...

16:01.600 --> 16:02.820
it mirrors his own lot.

16:05.790 --> 16:06.610
What are you thinking about?

16:10.440 --> 16:10.980
Nothing.

16:12.240 --> 16:12.650
Oh...

16:15.240 --> 16:15.850
this is for you.

16:16.360 --> 16:16.940
What is it?

16:17.480 --> 16:19.180
These were in your compartment.

16:19.960 --> 16:20.580
I didn't check it.

16:21.360 --> 16:22.220
You've never remembered

16:22.270 --> 16:23.180
your childhood, have you?

16:23.630 --> 16:24.820
See what's written on it.

16:35.870 --> 16:36.730
The past...

16:40.150 --> 16:40.850
why fuss over it?

16:43.320 --> 16:44.060
From here on, Blood River,

16:44.910 --> 16:45.460
you and I...

16:47.440 --> 16:48.220
have only tomorrow!

16:52.460 --> 16:54.750
[Ever Forward]

16:54.750 --> 16:55.220
Your Highness.

16:55.600 --> 16:56.010
General.

16:56.630 --> 16:58.010
The Imperial Father-in-Law's Manor is ablaze.

16:58.240 --> 17:00.010
Looks like... Blood River won.

17:01.360 --> 17:02.100
What about the Prince of Langya?

17:02.440 --> 17:03.650
He was ambushed at Fengxiao Temple,

17:04.070 --> 17:05.530
but he seems unharmed.

17:05.960 --> 17:06.490
Right now,

17:06.550 --> 17:07.660
he's returning with the Guardian Azure Dragon,

17:07.720 --> 17:08.180
Li Xinyue.

17:13.350 --> 17:14.050
You may go.

17:20.680 --> 17:23.380
The Shadow Sect really is worthless.

17:24.400 --> 17:26.220
I'd hoped this bout

17:27.000 --> 17:29.090
would leave them and the Langya faction

17:29.400 --> 17:30.810
both crippled.

17:33.440 --> 17:34.050
So be it.

17:34.550 --> 17:35.220
So be it.

17:36.030 --> 17:37.140
With the Shadow Sect gone,

17:38.000 --> 17:39.700
Father's fear of the Prince of Langya

17:40.070 --> 17:41.180
only deepens.

17:43.350 --> 17:44.490
Which means

17:46.880 --> 17:49.420
it's time to set my board.

17:57.310 --> 17:57.770
Muyu.

17:58.880 --> 18:00.290
Who's the Patriarch here anyway?

18:00.880 --> 18:01.530
Why doesn't anyone

18:01.590 --> 18:02.530
greet me first?

18:05.790 --> 18:07.180
How'd those goons

18:07.880 --> 18:08.460
you ran into fare?

18:09.240 --> 18:10.570
Changli's crew are handling the bodies.

18:10.960 --> 18:12.180
The Fengxiao Temple mission wrapped too.

18:12.440 --> 18:14.290
Uncle Qidao has gone back ahead.

18:14.640 --> 18:15.620
As for Mu Ciling,

18:16.310 --> 18:17.010
he said

18:17.110 --> 18:18.250
he's heading to the inn to heal first.

18:20.480 --> 18:22.620
When "dear Muyu" is done,

18:23.000 --> 18:24.010
go cure his poison.

18:24.350 --> 18:25.490
After that he'll be done

18:25.830 --> 18:26.700
with Blood River.

18:27.510 --> 18:27.940
Fine.

18:28.640 --> 18:29.460
I'll go in a bit.

18:31.750 --> 18:33.460
I meant to wait at the inn.

18:33.680 --> 18:35.290
Didn't expect we'd meet here first.

18:41.030 --> 18:41.860
You acted recklessly again?

18:50.550 --> 18:51.980
Your inner force is nearly spent.

18:54.310 --> 18:56.180
It will cost a lot of my good medicine.

18:58.720 --> 18:59.570
I wasn't reckless.

19:00.070 --> 19:00.730
I did what I could.

19:05.270 --> 19:05.980
He can vouch for me.

19:10.030 --> 19:10.530
I...

19:10.720 --> 19:11.660
I don't take your word for it.

19:18.000 --> 19:18.700
Xuewei and I

19:18.880 --> 19:19.900
will check on Changli.

19:20.480 --> 19:21.530
If they're done,

19:21.790 --> 19:23.050
we'll head back to the house.

19:25.400 --> 19:26.090
Young miracle physician,

19:28.550 --> 19:29.570
I tried to kill you last time...

19:30.960 --> 19:31.490
Sorry about that.

19:32.830 --> 19:33.620
No worries.

19:33.880 --> 19:34.770
We were just on different sides.

19:35.200 --> 19:35.900
Don't dwell on it.

19:36.110 --> 19:37.050
It's all in the past.

19:39.030 --> 19:39.530
Farewell.

19:41.510 --> 19:41.980
Farewell.

19:46.070 --> 19:46.980
Farewell.

19:47.200 --> 19:47.730
Get lost.

20:09.110 --> 20:10.180
You're not taking your best buddy here?

20:13.720 --> 20:15.460
I took it as a given you'd come with me.

20:17.920 --> 20:18.860
At Wanjuan Tower,

20:20.240 --> 20:20.980
I learned a few things

20:21.030 --> 20:22.420
about No-Sword City.

20:24.270 --> 20:25.140
I need to make a trip to Homeland.

20:25.960 --> 20:26.940
Homeland?

20:28.830 --> 20:30.380
Why are you still wasting time here?

20:31.270 --> 20:32.250
Everything's packed?

20:32.880 --> 20:34.570
We're assassins out to kill.

20:34.830 --> 20:35.730
What's there to pack?

20:36.640 --> 20:37.490
My father headed back

20:37.550 --> 20:38.290
to Nan'an City ahead of me.

20:38.550 --> 20:39.380
What about you two?

20:40.480 --> 20:41.250
Coming with us

20:41.880 --> 20:42.810
or heading back to Blood River?

20:50.750 --> 20:51.900
I've got matters to handle.

20:53.920 --> 20:54.620
Once they're done,

20:55.400 --> 20:56.420
I'll come to Nan'an for you.

21:01.590 --> 21:02.050
All right.

21:12.240 --> 21:12.860
You may go.

21:13.200 --> 21:13.730
Got it.

21:16.740 --> 21:18.820
[Xiao Ruojin, Emperor Mingde]

21:23.240 --> 21:23.810
Your Majesty.

21:26.830 --> 21:27.940
Here so early to see me,

21:28.680 --> 21:29.570
what is it?

21:30.960 --> 21:32.770
[Jin Xuan, Great Eunuch]
Last night the Shadow Sect burned down.

21:33.510 --> 21:34.570
Imperial Father-in-Law Yi Bu

21:35.790 --> 21:36.570
was burned to death.

21:38.480 --> 21:39.460
Yi Bu is dead?

21:40.270 --> 21:40.730
Yes.

21:41.480 --> 21:42.460
The blaze was massive.

21:43.640 --> 21:46.050
The entire manor is gone.

21:47.200 --> 21:48.330
Countless casualties.

21:50.960 --> 21:51.860
So that means...

21:53.030 --> 21:54.420
From last night,

21:55.550 --> 21:56.810
the Shadow Sect no longer exists.

22:00.640 --> 22:02.220
Did he need to be that ruthless?

22:04.920 --> 22:06.490
Two of a trade seldom agree.

22:07.920 --> 22:08.660
Besides,

22:09.960 --> 22:11.770
he never liked Yi Bu.

22:17.200 --> 22:18.180
Was it really him?

22:18.960 --> 22:20.700
A secret report reached the palace

22:21.790 --> 22:22.620
that last night,

22:23.400 --> 22:24.730
he wasn't at his own manor.

22:26.350 --> 22:27.570
Ending it so absolutely

22:28.680 --> 22:30.330
doesn't quite fit his style.

22:31.030 --> 22:32.770
But our prince

22:33.510 --> 22:35.860
isn't the man he was anymore,

22:36.920 --> 22:37.490
is he?

22:43.960 --> 22:44.530
Enough.

22:45.440 --> 22:46.290
Call it an accidental fire

22:46.720 --> 22:47.620
and leave it at that.

22:48.270 --> 22:49.490
Have the Court of Judicial Review handle it.

22:50.270 --> 22:51.010
As you command.

22:52.480 --> 22:53.380
Has Consort Xuan

22:54.070 --> 22:55.140
heard the news?

22:55.790 --> 22:56.730
The Seventh Prince

22:57.200 --> 22:59.730
entered the palace this morning.

23:00.480 --> 23:02.860
By now, Her Ladyship

23:03.270 --> 23:04.250
must know as well.

23:08.180 --> 23:12.620
[Prince of Langya's Manor]

23:17.440 --> 23:18.440
Why would Blood River

23:18.550 --> 23:20.380
help us wipe out the Shadow Sect?

23:23.240 --> 23:25.490
You think I hired them?

23:26.240 --> 23:27.770
Those earlier attempts on my life

23:27.960 --> 23:29.570
were staged as a setup.

23:31.880 --> 23:32.940
It's not what I think.

23:33.240 --> 23:35.090
It's what everyone in Tianqi City will think.

23:35.240 --> 23:36.900
They'll all link the fall of the Shadow Sect to you.

23:37.960 --> 23:39.050
And your elder brother

23:40.110 --> 23:41.090
will think so too.

23:42.400 --> 23:43.770
Then let them think so. I don't care.

23:45.110 --> 23:45.940
I don't believe

23:46.000 --> 23:47.330
you'd choose that method.

23:49.350 --> 23:51.010
Which is why you and I can be friends.

23:51.960 --> 23:53.010
This wasn't my doing.

23:53.830 --> 23:55.530
Yi Bu dug his own grave,

23:55.720 --> 23:56.770
you could say.

23:57.720 --> 23:59.420
Su Changhe and Su Muyu of Blood River

23:59.510 --> 24:00.800
are remarkable.

24:01.070 --> 24:02.330
They said they'd change Blood River.

24:03.310 --> 24:04.460
I don't think that's empty talk.

24:05.270 --> 24:06.290
They've cut every chain

24:06.350 --> 24:07.620
on their necks.

24:07.880 --> 24:09.380
They're no longer someone else's pawns.

24:10.030 --> 24:11.050
The only shackles left

24:12.110 --> 24:14.460
are rumor and prejudice.

24:17.350 --> 24:18.730
But that's the hardest part.

24:21.440 --> 24:22.770
If I can,

24:23.720 --> 24:25.980
I'll lend them a hand.

24:31.400 --> 24:32.180
Su Muyu?

24:33.160 --> 24:33.940
Su Muyu?

24:34.480 --> 24:35.770
Let's go hear a tune together!

24:36.270 --> 24:36.700
Su...

24:43.660 --> 24:46.160
[Tianqi]

24:46.160 --> 24:47.320
Once we leave,

24:47.400 --> 24:49.330
who knows when we'll return to Tianqi City.

24:49.750 --> 24:51.180
I hope when we come back,

24:52.000 --> 24:53.380
we can truly walk the long street

24:53.400 --> 24:54.530
with nothing weighing on our minds.

24:55.640 --> 24:56.980
Walk through the Entertainment Street

24:57.200 --> 24:58.420
with nothing on your mind, huh?

25:00.240 --> 25:01.660
That's your father's wish.

25:04.640 --> 25:06.090
You little brat,

25:06.480 --> 25:07.770
teasing Uncle Zhe again.

25:10.720 --> 25:11.250
Changhe.

25:12.510 --> 25:13.490
We'll make our dream come true,

25:13.490 --> 25:14.450
won't we?

25:15.270 --> 25:16.380
You call that a dream?

25:17.200 --> 25:18.860
Other people dream

25:18.880 --> 25:20.250
of being great generals for the realm,

25:20.440 --> 25:22.220
or sword heroes saving lives.

25:23.000 --> 25:23.530
But you...

25:26.160 --> 25:28.050
you just want to be ordinary.

25:30.550 --> 25:31.090
What about you?

25:32.000 --> 25:32.860
Does your dream

25:33.200 --> 25:34.250
count as a real dream?

25:34.510 --> 25:35.250
Of course!

25:36.000 --> 25:37.180
I'll not only lead Blood River

25:37.240 --> 25:38.250
into the sunlight,

25:39.350 --> 25:40.730
I'll be the light.

25:42.310 --> 25:42.770
All right.

25:43.640 --> 25:44.860
Then I'll be your sword.

25:45.220 --> 25:51.540
♪All grudges and storms ended with you...♪

25:56.830 --> 25:59.140
Then let me treat your wounds.

25:59.720 --> 26:01.290
If I can't cure you,

26:01.790 --> 26:02.980
my father can always

26:03.200 --> 26:04.900
collect your bodies.

26:07.160 --> 26:07.570
All right.

26:08.480 --> 26:08.980
Deal.

26:09.680 --> 26:10.380
Deal.

26:13.020 --> 26:17.780
♪I'm lucky to meet you♪

26:17.780 --> 26:21.540
[A summer solstice rain, worth its weight in gold]

26:21.540 --> 26:23.540
[Today is the Summer Solstice]

26:23.540 --> 26:26.540
[Days at their longest, all things at their peak]

26:36.960 --> 26:37.900
So this is Homeland?

26:38.920 --> 26:40.810
Looks a bit ordinary.

26:42.160 --> 26:43.050
A homeland

26:44.000 --> 26:45.420
should be ordinary by nature.

26:47.550 --> 26:48.900
You really can make sense of anything.

26:55.240 --> 26:56.160
Didn't you say

26:56.160 --> 26:57.140
you'd come for me soon?

26:57.510 --> 26:59.290
How did "soon" turn into years?

27:00.590 --> 27:01.140
Yeah.

27:01.790 --> 27:03.010
Blink, and it's years.

27:04.110 --> 27:04.490
Oh,

27:05.440 --> 27:06.180
this is Changhe,

27:06.680 --> 27:07.770
Blood River's Patriarch now.

27:08.440 --> 27:09.140
I'm Changhe,

27:09.720 --> 27:11.010
Muyu's best friend.

27:11.510 --> 27:11.940
From now on,

27:12.400 --> 27:13.530
just call me Changhe.

27:14.480 --> 27:15.090
This is Zhaoyan,

27:15.440 --> 27:16.240
[Xiao Zhaoyan]
Xiao Zhaoyan in full.

27:16.440 --> 27:17.250
We grew up together

27:17.310 --> 27:18.420
in No-Sword City.

27:19.070 --> 27:19.900
She's like my sister.

27:22.440 --> 27:23.180
Muyu,

27:24.000 --> 27:24.860
why do I feel

27:25.240 --> 27:26.900
like you're matchmaking?

27:29.790 --> 27:31.050
I was teasing him,

27:31.510 --> 27:32.620
now he's getting back at me.

27:37.680 --> 27:39.460
Blood River rakes in silver all year,

27:39.830 --> 27:41.090
yet this "homeland"

27:41.200 --> 27:42.180
is a poor village.

27:42.830 --> 27:43.700
Master Su

27:43.920 --> 27:45.140
is downright stingy.

27:46.070 --> 27:47.510
We eat meat every meal

27:47.510 --> 27:48.220
and drink every time.

27:48.350 --> 27:49.290
How's that poor?

27:49.920 --> 27:50.460
Sounds to me

27:50.640 --> 27:52.050
you've never seen real poverty.

27:52.680 --> 27:53.530
Seventeen li from here,

27:53.830 --> 27:55.090
in the next village,

27:55.720 --> 27:56.530
those folks

27:56.960 --> 27:57.920
call a bowl of white rice

27:57.920 --> 27:58.950
a New Year feast.

27:59.310 --> 28:00.010
Ignore him.

28:00.590 --> 28:02.220
Poor too long, flush now, he gets like this.

28:04.030 --> 28:05.730
"Flush now", my foot.

28:06.310 --> 28:07.530
Did you forget Nan'an City

28:07.750 --> 28:09.220
has silver buried all over the ground?

28:10.110 --> 28:11.770
I think our place is great.

28:12.030 --> 28:12.810
We don't need your silver.

28:15.480 --> 28:16.220
Do you know

28:16.640 --> 28:17.380
who all live

28:17.830 --> 28:18.810
in this place?

28:19.200 --> 28:19.940
Of course I do.

28:21.000 --> 28:22.900
People tied to Blood River

28:23.160 --> 28:24.010
but unwilling to be dragged

28:24.070 --> 28:24.770
into jianghu strife.

28:30.790 --> 28:32.010
Zhaoyan, we've got guests?

28:32.240 --> 28:32.900
Uncle Xiemo,

28:33.110 --> 28:33.730
please, have a seat.

28:34.680 --> 28:35.140
Zhaoyan,

28:35.720 --> 28:36.770
pour Uncle some tea.

28:37.110 --> 28:37.570
Okay.

28:44.750 --> 28:45.460
I'm Su Changhe.

28:48.310 --> 28:48.980
I'm Su Muyu.

28:50.200 --> 28:51.140
You're of the Su family?

28:52.830 --> 28:54.330
Senior, may I ask your surname.

28:57.400 --> 28:58.460
Same as yours.

28:59.270 --> 29:00.700
When I left home,

29:01.350 --> 29:03.140
I hadn't heard your names.

29:03.680 --> 29:04.730
By then,

29:05.400 --> 29:06.980
you should've been born.

29:07.510 --> 29:09.050
But we've heard yours, Senior,

29:10.000 --> 29:11.700
Su Xiemo, the Seven-Sword Star-Chaser.

29:12.350 --> 29:13.940
You codename was once the Soul-Chasing Ghost.

29:14.720 --> 29:16.010
To kill one man,

29:16.070 --> 29:17.140
you'd chase him three thousand li.

29:19.880 --> 29:20.570
However,

29:21.200 --> 29:22.660
we heard you died

29:22.720 --> 29:24.290
in the wastelands beyond Mo River.

29:28.310 --> 29:30.460
Never thought you'd be here in Homeland.

29:31.790 --> 29:32.810
I survived,

29:33.880 --> 29:34.620
but...

29:35.000 --> 29:36.770
I lost the right to be a killer.

29:37.590 --> 29:38.900
The Patriarch took pity on me

29:39.240 --> 29:40.900
and settled me in Homeland

29:41.270 --> 29:42.660
to keep it safe.

29:43.960 --> 29:44.460
Oh,

29:45.310 --> 29:46.250
you two

29:46.550 --> 29:48.220
still haven't answered my question.

29:50.110 --> 29:51.090
We're from the Nameless,

29:52.400 --> 29:54.330
but I'm now Blood River's Patriarch,

29:54.960 --> 29:56.140
and this one beside me

29:56.510 --> 29:58.090
is the current head of the Su family.

30:03.920 --> 30:05.140
In that case,

30:07.880 --> 30:08.980
this cup of tea

30:09.480 --> 30:10.530
should be served to you.

30:16.550 --> 30:17.380
Then,

30:17.960 --> 30:18.810
I won't refuse.

30:19.680 --> 30:20.250
I'll gladly accept it.

30:42.200 --> 30:43.620
As expected of the Patriarch,

30:44.440 --> 30:45.290
fine skill.

30:46.310 --> 30:47.290
Let me pour you another, Uncle.

30:51.750 --> 30:52.620
Since you

30:52.640 --> 30:53.620
came here,

30:54.790 --> 30:57.940
it means Master Su is dead.

30:59.200 --> 31:00.810
The ones holding power in Blood River now

31:01.790 --> 31:02.810
have become you

31:02.830 --> 31:03.730
from the Nameless.

31:04.880 --> 31:06.940
Something major must have happened.

31:08.590 --> 31:09.250
Then,

31:10.000 --> 31:11.530
your purpose here

31:12.830 --> 31:13.730
is to...

31:14.220 --> 31:19.660
[Blood River members involved in the Wushuang City attack: Su Xiemo...]

31:22.460 --> 31:25.940
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

31:25.980 --> 31:29.860
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

31:31.700 --> 31:35.180
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

31:35.220 --> 31:39.060
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

31:41.060 --> 31:44.340
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

31:44.460 --> 31:46.540
♪Still I can't let go♪

31:46.700 --> 31:50.140
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

31:50.620 --> 31:52.820
♪My heart no longer my own♪

31:52.940 --> 31:57.940
♪No one can escape from love♪

32:14.540 --> 32:18.260
♪How many hidden feelings♪

32:18.380 --> 32:22.460
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

32:23.700 --> 32:27.580
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

32:27.700 --> 32:31.940
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

32:33.060 --> 32:35.940
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

32:36.020 --> 32:40.260
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

32:42.540 --> 32:46.540
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

32:46.580 --> 32:50.020
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

32:51.540 --> 32:54.980
